    "content": "<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none;\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style></head><body dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">A few comments:</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Reliability first is right. The calendar overlay is two sprints, not one, if we include free/busy for external attendees. I'd move inline previews to Q2 to make room.</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Harper</div><div id=\"appendonsend\"></div><hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div id=\"divRplyFwdMsg\" dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Parker Patel &lt;parker.patel@example.com&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> Friday, October 9, 2026 4:30 PM<br><b>To:</b> Alex Example &lt;you@example.com&gt;; Harper Hale &lt;harper.hale@example.com&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Devon Dahl &lt;devon.dahl@example.com&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Q1 planning: roadmap draft</font><div>&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Hi all,</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">The first pass at the Q1 roadmap is in the planning folder: <a href=\"https://example.com/planning/q1-roadmap\">https://example.com/planning/q1-roadmap</a>. It has three themes:<ul><li><b>Reliability</b>: offline sync and crash-free sessions above 99.8%</li><li><b>Calendar</b>: shared calendar overlay and a scheduling assistant</li><li><b>Files</b>: inline previews and sharing links</li></ul></div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Comments by Wednesday, please, so I can bring a v2 to leadership review on Monday the 19th.</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Parker</div></body></html>"
